vwG6l-Ix&_nc_oc=AdkSnE2wwdZtyges6YZ6pe0WDL8KIuY034Bk3L8gzsqxqMqBO4MPu8Fbv0RkMRe68B4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuDwxq6krx4AxknpiA-WEIbiBzElawW_8bsVC47tVMKmA&oe=69A1A1D4"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "497880493079740", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392030_497880496413073_6685533152652071397_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tAs31CHLNXQQ7kNvwHMKf49&_nc_oc=AdlM8CZJ1fxKXTKSdqzF6Rj9igP4d_Cf9UHlbwM0j6YBEdStwLobz5xxbNKKSlrLrDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvInwINFxWrEyIPfuWYOsYCgb71iiaBO_Lwr9660GYMew&oe=69A1AB4E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "spiderarttestTitle.png", "id": "1277705199969122", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473397684_1277705203302455_7259243560357786598_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BBYm6I14XJwQ7kNvwGycGkE&_nc_oc=AdlH8_yXQCmyAxpoQ2eELuAN54frVUUSl07cbX0MrwnHY00m64kc_H115Ba1tAa4abo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsqGxB9qO7jMv3ENmtdRpgjhBGsOrpCGSTzJxqX83JFpw&oe=69A18858"}, "display_name": "Spiders", "keywords": ["Spiders", "hangout", "social", "multiplayer", "climbing"], "long_description": "Spiders is a social VR experience where you inhabit a colorful arachnid and climb around finding cocoons to deliver to a nest. \n\nYou can steal cocoons from other spiders to score points, and the first spider to 10 points wins the crown! It's a deceptively simple game that's easy to pick up and hard to master. \n\nIn Spiders you can : \n\n- be a Spider!\n- choose your color\n- deck out your Arachnid in special cosmetic gear\n- make new friends (and enemies!)\n\nWith social features and addictive gameplay, Spiders is a casual, fun hangout experience that can be taken seriously as you desire, or as chill as you want. ", "short_description": "Arachnid activities for your bug buddies. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soaringrocstudi